OL,3,CAirport apologises as passengers miss
OL,4,Cflights due to security delays
OL,6,FThe new Managing Director of Jersey
OL,7,FAirport has apologised after a number
OL,8,Fof passengers missed their flights due
OL,9,Fto long delays at security.
OL,11,FIn a video posted on social media
OL,12,Funder the headline "We're sorry", Dale
OL,13,FReeson thanked everyone for their
OL,14,Fpatience and said he wanted "to
OL,15,Fsincerely apologise to all of those
OL,16,Fwho were affected" by the issues on
OL,17,FTuesday morning (28 July).
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
