PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785383018
OL,3,CAirport apologises as passengers miss
OL,4,Cflights due to security delays
OL,6,FHe added: "Following unexpected staff
OL,7,Fillness, processing through security
OL,8,Fscreening was temporarily slower than
OL,9,Fusual and that led to longer queues
OL,10,Fand delays for some passengers.
OL,12,F"My team have worked with those
OL,13,Faffected to ensure they got to their
OL,14,Fdestination as quickly as possible.
OL,16,F"I want to assure you we know how
OL,17,Fimportant travel plans are and
OL,18,Fcompletely understand how frustrating
OL,19,Fand stressful it is when things don't
OL,20,Fgo to plan."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785383018
OL,3,CAirport apologises as passengers miss
OL,4,Cflights due to security delays
OL,6,FJersey Airport did not confirm how
OL,7,Fmany passengers had missed their
OL,8,Fflights, but Mr Reeson said "an
OL,9,Fimmediate and thorough review" had
OL,10,Fstarted "to make sure this doesn't
OL,11,Fhappen again".
OL,13,FIn a separate statement, he added:
OL,14,F"Providing a safe, smooth and reliable
OL,15,Fexperience for all passengers
OL,16,Ftravelling through Jersey Airport
OL,17,Fremains our priority and we thank
OL,18,Feveryone for their patience and
OL,19,Funderstanding."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
