CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785383018
OL,3,CAirport apologises as passengers miss
OL,4,Cflights due to security delays
OL,6,FLast November, a "technical fault" at
OL,7,Fsecurity saw 17 passengers miss their
OL,8,Fflights.
OL,10,FThe island's airport handles more than
OL,11,F1.4 million passengers a year and is
OL,12,Fcurrently undergoing a major revamp; A
OL,13,Fnew departures hall under construction
OL,14,Fwhich officials hope will provide a
OL,15,Fmuch better experience for travellers.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/4
